{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03962","headline":"奉和立春日内出彩花树应制 · 刘宪","name":"奉和立春日内出彩花树应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禁苑韶年此日归，东郊道上转青旗。\n柳色梅芳何处所，风前雪里觅芳菲。\n开冰池内鱼新跃，剪彩花间燕始飞。\n欲识王游布阳气，爲观天藻竞春晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}